00:41:02.726 --> 00:41:03.961 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, actually,
while you're looking,

00:41:03.961 --> 00:41:04.995
I'll mention something else.

00:41:04.995 --> 00:41:06.230
So you can look for a second.

00:41:06.230 --> 00:41:07.498
But one of the things
that I really liked

00:41:07.498 --> 00:41:08.966
and I will hold the
book up for a second

00:41:08.966 --> 00:41:11.435 align:start size:97% position:3%
is that I like that you
put the photos in here too,

00:41:11.435 --> 00:41:14.071
because you don't see that
in books that much anymore.

00:41:14.071 --> 00:41:16.273 align:start size:97% position:3%
It used to, I feel like photos
always used to be in books,

00:41:16.273 --> 00:41:17.741 align:start size:84% position:16%
and you don't really
see it anymore.

00:41:17.741 --> 00:41:21.412 align:start size:97% position:3%
But when you just see, these
are just regular people,

00:41:21.412 --> 00:41:24.415
young girl, you know, the 9/11,

00:41:24.415 --> 00:41:26.417
the, you know, just
guys on the street,

00:41:26.417 --> 00:41:27.918 line:0%
people with glamor
shots, you're like,

00:41:27.918 --> 00:41:31.922 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
"Oh", it reminds you that, you
know, we're all just human.

00:41:31.922 --> 00:41:33.324 line:0%
That's all it is.

00:41:33.324 --> 00:41:34.792
- It's true, I'm
glad you said that,

00:41:34.792 --> 00:41:36.794 align:start size:88% position:13%
because I really fought
hard to make sure

00:41:36.794 --> 00:41:38.295
that their pictures
were in the book.

00:41:38.295 --> 00:41:40.130
You know how you read a book,

00:41:40.130 --> 00:41:43.934 align:start size:84% position:16%
